Who Built the First Time Machine? — Archive Light Table
A short film made from public-domain scans. No AI-generated images, no stock footage. Every light, mark, card and
label is drawn by the page (WebGL2 + 2D canvas). Every claim and its source: FACTS.md. Scans accessed 2026-10-29.

